        "original_id": "ab899276-5bfb-519c-90e4-9c35c8298d23",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Tampa International Airport, John F. Kennedy International Airport, Downtown Tampa, Hillsborough County, Florida, New York City\n- Concepts: Airport codes, public airports, international airports\n\nFacts:\n- Tampa International Airport has IATA code TPA, ICAO code KTPA, and FAA LID TPA.\n- Tampa International Airport is a public airport located six miles west of Downtown Tampa in Hillsborough County, Florida, United States.\n- John F. Kennedy International Airport has IATA code JFK, ICAO code KJFK, and FAA LID JFK.\n- John F. Kennedy International Airport is often referred to as Kennedy Airport or simply JFK.\n- John F. Kennedy International Airport is the primary international airport serving New York City.",
